      "content": "For a corporate compliance environment, you must maintain a rigorously objective tone, even when describing an operational challenge. I advise framing this \"vibe\" not as a mischievous entity, but as a systemic characteristic of the control environment. You can describe the pattern as exhibiting **low-magnitude, high-frequency anomalies** that demonstrate **adaptive evasion** of existing checkpoints. This language is precise, neutral, and conveys the complexity without resorting to anthropomorphism, which is crucial for board-level reporting. It suggests the issues are not random errors, but rather a sophisticated, persistent pattern of circumvention.",
      "source": "target",
